  "Package": "toppgene",
  "Title": "Gene List Enrichment Analysis using the ToppGene Suite",
  "Version": "0.99.1",
  "Authors@R": "c(\nperson(\"Pariksheet Nanda\",\nemail = \"pan79@pitt.edu\",\nrole = c(\"aut\", \"cre\"),\ncomment = c(ORCID = \"0000-0001-9726-4552\")),\nperson(\"Jason Shoemaker\",\nemail = \"jason.shoemaker@pitt.edu\",\nrole = \"fnd\",\ncomment = c(ORCID = \"0000-0003-3315-7103\")))",
  "Description": "The ToppGene Suite is a one-stop portal for gene list\nenrichment analysis and candidate gene prioritization based on\nfunctional annotations and protein interactions network.\nAlthough the ToppCluster web application provides convenient\ngraphical access to the ToppGene Suite, the OpenAPI 3.0\ncompliant interface of ToppGene is better suited for automation\nand reproducibility.  This package includes Bioconductor class\ninterfaces and biological examples.",
